SUMMARY:after work bike ride on the ATT 
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nWe'll be starting near Sou
 thpoint and final starting point will be sent out Monday evening.\n\nMake 
 sure that your bike is in good working order - tires hold air and are up t
 o pressure\, brakes and shifters work and your chain has been oiled.\n\nWe
 'll be riding slightly over 1 3/4 hour and about 21 miles. The ride is fai
 rly flat and shaded and our pace will be moderate (about 12 mph average). 
 I recommend a hard tail or hybrid bike\, but if you really want to bring a
  road bike it's ok\, though you'll likely be a bit bored. Unicycles....?\n
 \nI'll be eating after the ride at a restaurant. You're welcome to join me
  if you like.\n\nHelmets are required and by signing up you agree to THOG 
 liability waiver statement.\n\nPlease Note!! Any cancellation less than 30
  hours before the beginning of the event will be considered a "no show"
